"⟪k:0⟫If you continue along the path beyond the fallen bridge, there’s a forest—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that’s "
"where I found you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫사라진 다리를 지나 ⟪k:1⟫더 나아가면―― 숲이 있어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫맞아, ⟪k:4⟫네가 방황하던 방향이지."

