msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If you make it through that, there’s a mansion—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫which is said to be cursed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 일대를 지나면 ⟪k:1⟫한 저택이 나와.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫소문이 무성한…… 저주받은 저택이야."

