msgid "⟪k:0⟫The witch who supposedly destroyed this city lives in the house deep in the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫과거에 도시를 멸망시켰단 마녀는 ⟪k:1⟫숲 속 저택에서 살았어."

