msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She’s been there for years and years and years,⟪k:1⟫and she casts her curse on anyone who "
"goes near it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 마녀는 ⟪k:1⟫시간이 지난 지금도 저택에 머무르며…… 접근한 자에게 저주를 뿌려."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0AC1EF47_C191_4183_882B_4A5D98F3571F
