"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t have been more blessed that such a kind man had found me and welcomed me into his "
"village."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫친절한 사람이 구해 주고 ⟪k:1⟫마을의 일원으로 환영해 주는 것……. ⟪k:2⟫그건 ⟪k:3⟫몹시 크나큰 요"
"행이리라."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD1E4CFA_CA65_45AD_AFB4_542C2A8574BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28ecbf7878a9dacd6cc674b094f5d616c0ad2e864af60147ef036f06125ba5ed
