msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Coming from a merchant’s family, everything felt so new. ⟪k:1⟫I had never plowed a large "
"plot of land, milked a cow, or used a loom before."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나는 오랫동안 장사를 했다 보니, ⟪k:1⟫모든 게 색달랐다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫대규모 밭을 일구는 것, ⟪k:4⟫"
"소젖을 짜는 것, ⟪k:5⟫베를 짜는 것도."

#: scenario5:scenario5_061F026E_B30B_4ED7_BF5D_CD23E9ECE7F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11d8cc6ef9f7f835629db4ed6b1a91d78b97a58f978e2192315e2bbe7d4f509f
