"⟪k:0⟫but over time, I grew more comfortable with my new life, and the people of the village "
"started thinking of me as one of them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래도 점차 생활에 적응했고――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫마을 사람들도 ⟪k:3⟫나를 소중한 일원으로 인정해 주었다."

