msgid "⟪k:0⟫Haha, thanks.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Though I’d rather give my affection to my own kids."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하하, ⟪k:1⟫고마워. ⟪k:2⟫하지만 가능하면 ⟪k:3⟫내 자식을 사랑하고 싶더라."

